```
The `*.pca.coordinates` fields are included to allow visualization of the traces. They do not contribute to the guardrail score.

The `prompt.pii` metric comprises a set of individual PII metrics as described in the section on [Secure Container Metrics](/llm-metrics#pii)

The overall guardrail score for the prompt is calculated by first normalizing the constituent metrics to be within the range from
0 to 100 and then taking the maximum value of the normalized metrics.

